      "verified": true,
      "checked_original": true,
      "accessed_on": "2026-10-03",
      "authority_reason": "Hugging Face Transformers維護者的固定版本官方原碼。",
      "inspection_note": "MaxLengthCriteria L59–85；EosTokenCriteria L452–473；EOS criterion檢查input_ids最後一項，並非掃描全部歷史。長度criterion依token軸長度>=上限停止。兩者是分開的程序條件。；持久自有筆記見a_sources。"
